  m_text: 'Here, relax and enjoy our one-of-a-kind resort featuring the perfect activity
    for all ages:

    1. The inflatable castle to the left for young children

    2.
    Skiing at the mountain ahead for older kids and above

    3. Diving for brave
    explorers - see the screen to the right

