    - target: {fileID: 4185366886401676623, guid: 36edad79980514fde91bbdaf000515b1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Robots have transformed modern surgery by extending the accuracy and
        control of human surgeons.

        This robot, inspired by the da Vinci
        Surgical System allows surgeons to operate with robotic arms controlled from
        a console by translating hand movements into extremely precise actions inside
        the body.

        Used for over 14 million procedures since 2000, da Vinci
        enables minimally invasive procedures with smaller incisions, improved accuracy,
        and faster patient recovery.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
