    - target: {fileID: 4185366886401676623, guid: 36edad79980514fde91bbdaf000515b1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Robots have been essential to space exploration from its very beginning.

        Robotic
        spacecraft and probes have traveled to the Moon, Mars, asteroids, and the
        outer planets, extending human curiosity and discovery far beyond Earth.

        Rovers
        explore planetary surfaces, landers study local environments, and orbiters
        worlds from space. Some robots even fly, drill, or deploy instruments to
        study distant terrain in detail.'
